      "type": "single_choice",
      "prompt": "（2007考研题）设函数$f(x)$在$x=0$处连续，下列命题错误的是（）。",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "若$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}$存在，则$f(0)=0$。"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "若$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)+f(-x)}{x}$存在，则$f(0)=0$。"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "若$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}$存在，则$f'(0)$存在。"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "若$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{f(x)-f(-x)}{x}$存在，则$f'(0)$存在。"
        }
      ],
      "answer": null,
      "children": []
    }
